    "show_share": true,
    "description": "This past quarter has been both energising and inspiring for the Brain and Mind Institute (BMI). Across Africa and South Asia, we have seen encouraging progress. Stronger partnerships, new initiatives and growing momentum for brain and mental health research that is rooted in local leadership and global collaboration.",
